title: Fix boolean handling of CI change-filter outputs

doc:
  - audience: Node Dev
    description: |
      Compare GitHub Actions change-filter outputs explicitly with 'true' before combining
      them and when deciding whether to run existing guarded jobs. Changes excluded by the
      current file filters now skip those jobs, while Rust changes and changes to the caller
      workflow or shared preflight continue to run them. File filters and event exclusions
      are unchanged. No crates require publishing.
crates: []
